  "rationale": "Reference baseline, not a candidate: the classical D^2-law with the published median rate, replaced by the prefix's own finite-difference rate as the prefix grows; no extinction, no cool flame, no evaporation. The fitted D^2 baselines of the repository refuse heptane (their population is methanol), so this literal release stands in for them.",
